{"3134820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yurko", "steam_appid": 3134820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are part of <strong>Yurko</strong> — an International Nuclear Security Bureau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate 1964, after the collapse of the Soviet Union, the world slips into a global political crisis.<br>You operate a failing Arctic nuclear base — isolated, under pressure, and cut off from reliable support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system is connected. Every decision carries risk.<br>Failures cascade. Mistakes escalate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of unreliable information and rising tension, even a single wrong call can bring you closer to nuclear war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your role is to prevent it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a failing nuclear base — control the reactor, route power, and keep the heat alive. One failure — everything goes down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intercept, negotiate, or wait — choose wrong, and the world burns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radio signals, readouts, and even your perception can distort or lie — you may see or hear things that aren’t real. Trust nothing. Verify everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against aircraft that evade, jam, and fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the base to gather resources in a hostile Arctic. Every trip is a risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blizzards disrupt visibility, communication, and detection systems, forcing you to adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fixed roles — run systems, man the gun, drive, handle radio. Play solo or with a team, switch on the fly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is a single night. Survive until dawn — or collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end, the base itself may become your only way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Reactor to power. Power to heat.</i><br><i>Heat to everything that keeps you alive.</i><br><i>Break one — and everything goes with it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You won’t hold everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The higher the load, the hotter the reactor.</i> <br><i>The higher the stress, the faster your mind slips.</i> <br><i>The more mistakes you make, the closer you get to nuclear war.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The system does not wait.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/be5710966bb748273d41e104a5b16e14.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/be5710966bb748273d41e104a5b16e14.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/be5710966bb748273d41e104a5b16e14.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>They said peace would follow the collapse.</i> <br><i>Three years later — a new Cold War.</i> <br><i>They are ready.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Are you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/b5e198c20976c2e379c164b364ede510.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/b5e198c20976c2e379c164b364ede510.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/b5e198c20976c2e379c164b364ede510.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They have missiles.   <br>They have aircraft and bombs.   <br>They have a thousand ways to end the world.  <br>You have four warheads, a radio, and a gun on the roof.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you negotiate — or act?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Blizzards intensify.<br>Resources run low.<br>Isolation grows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The longer it lasts — the worse it gets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\">From:<strong> <u>YURKO-HIGH-COMMAND</u></strong><br>To:<strong>      <u>YURKO-BASE</u></strong>                     <br><i>NO FURTHER TRANSMISSION</i>     </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are part of <strong>Yurko</strong> — an International Nuclear Security Bureau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate 1964, after the collapse of the Soviet Union, the world slips into a global political crisis.<br>You operate a failing Arctic nuclear base — isolated, under pressure, and cut off from reliable support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system is connected. Every decision carries risk.<br>Failures cascade. Mistakes escalate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of unreliable information and rising tension, even a single wrong call can bring you closer to nuclear war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your role is to prevent it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a failing nuclear base — control the reactor, route power, and keep the heat alive. One failure — everything goes down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intercept, negotiate, or wait — choose wrong, and the world burns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radio signals, readouts, and even your perception can distort or lie — you may see or hear things that aren’t real. Trust nothing. Verify everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against aircraft that evade, jam, and fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the base to gather resources in a hostile Arctic. Every trip is a risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blizzards disrupt visibility, communication, and detection systems, forcing you to adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fixed roles — run systems, man the gun, drive, handle radio. Play solo or with a team, switch on the fly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session is a single night. Survive until dawn — or collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end, the base itself may become your only way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/45589ff072259c0d9cb8fb349bb750d8.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Reactor to power. Power to heat.</i><br><i>Heat to everything that keeps you alive.</i><br><i>Break one — and everything goes with it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You won’t hold everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/1be896c2f7db2250baf824905a286d99.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The higher the load, the hotter the reactor.</i> <br><i>The higher the stress, the faster your mind slips.</i> <br><i>The more mistakes you make, the closer you get to nuclear war.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The system does not wait.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\