aph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.poster.avif?t=1776943661\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.webm?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/extras/401fdbae6832631c1684b09ca156ffcc.mp4?t=1776943661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Blizzards intensify.<br>Resources run low.<br>Isolation grows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The longer it lasts — the worse it gets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\">From:<strong> <u>YURKO-HIGH-COMMAND</u></strong><br>To:<strong>      <u>YURKO-BASE</u></strong>                     <br><i>NO FURTHER TRANSMISSION</i>     </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A co-op survival thriller about running an Arctic base on the brink of nuclear war after the Soviet Union’s collapse in 1964.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3134820/51402971b33d33722b2130272bf57f290e01293d/header.jpg?t=1776943661", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a